function parseEndpoint(value){const m=String(value).match(/^\[([^\]]+)\]:(\d+)$/)||String(value).match(/^([^:\s]+):(\d+)$/);if(!m)return null;const port=+m[2];return port>=1&&port<=65535&&Number.isInteger(port)?{host:m[1]==='localhost'?'127.0.0.1':m[1],port}:null;}
